WEBVTT

00:00:28.234 --> 00:00:31.165
staroslavenska riječ rabota

00:00:31.165 --> 00:00:34.180
opisivala je prisilan rad ljudi.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:36.478
Malom prilagodbom u pisanju

00:00:36.478 --> 00:00:40.845
rabota je postala robota na češkom,

00:00:40.845 --> 00:00:44.610
koja se, da bi definirala napor kmetova,

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:46.700
koristila i figurativno

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:50.310
za opis bilo kojeg teškog
ili napornog rada.

00:00:51.095 --> 00:00:55.118
Godine 1920. češki pisac
Karel Čapek je objavio

00:00:55.118 --> 00:00:59.131
znanstveno-fantastičnu dramu "R. U. R.",

00:00:59.131 --> 00:01:03.540
kratica od "Rossumovi univerzalni roboti".